A stylized calendar icon with a sun on the top left and a moon on the bottom right, set against a gradient background that fades from light blue at the top to dark blue at the bottom. The calendar has a simple white border and a subtle shadow to give it depth. The sun is a bright yellow circle with rays, while the moon is a pale silver crescent. The overall design is clean, modern, and conveys the idea of time and days.
